The relevant theory comes from factors of production and how businesses combine them. Identify which definition or relationship the sentence is trying to test before deciding true or false.

Applied carefully, technology used to deliver services is a production factor. Nothing in the sentence stretches the concept beyond its standard use.

No qualifying word breaks the definition or scenario, so the answer is true.', 'TRUE — This statement is correct. Experience with fermentation techniques contributes knowledge to winemaking output.

