( '3.1', 'CASE 3.1.08', 'A small IT-support venture Repair Weekend', 'Consider how a small IT-support venture refurbish laptops, install software, and bill for weekend support calls. Evaluate the following economic assertions:', ARRAY['Their venture combines knowledge, labour, technology, capital, and entrepreneurship.', 'Coordinating bookings, parts orders, and repairs supplies entrepreneurship.', 'Repair kits and licensed diagnostic apps form the technology layer of the service offer.', 'Spare screens and batteries held for repairs are capital inputs for the workshop.', 'Staff time spent diagnosing faults counts as the labour input for the repair venture.'], ARRAY[true, true, true, true, true], ARRAY['TRUE — This statement is correct. Their venture combines knowledge, labour, technology, capital, and entrepreneurship.

